  c) use the Software for private, personal, non-commercial purposes, and
     for teaching and academic research that is not commissioned or paid
     for by a third party;
  d) make modifications for the purposes in a) to c);
  e) submit bug reports and contributions to the Licensor.

3. Commercial License (annual rental)

  a) Production Use requires a Commercial License. It is granted as a rental
     for one year at a time ("License Year") and costs EUR 5,000 (five
     thousand euros) per License Year, per legal entity together with its
     Affiliates, plus statutory VAT where applicable. The Commercial License
     is offered only as a bundle: one fee covers all three tools cosmos, ufo
     and kontor (https://github.com/Pymann/cosmos, /ufo and /kontor); they
     are not licensed separately.
  b) The fee is due in advance at the start of each License Year. A
     Commercial License renews for another License Year when the fee for it
     is paid, and ends at the end of the last License Year that was paid
     for.
  c) A Commercial License is granted by a written agreement or a paid
     invoice from the Licensor. That agreement may set further terms; where
     it differs from this license, the agreement prevails.
  d) During a paid License Year, You and Your Affiliates may install, run,
     copy and modify the Software for Production Use without limit on the
     number of users, machines or installations.
  e) When the Commercial License ends, You must stop all Production Use. You
     may keep the copies You need to meet legal retention duties.

